...@../../_tools/theme
shape: sequence_diagram

user: 사용자 { class: person }
script: 최상위 스크립트 (support_ticket_agent.py) { class: ours }
runner: Runner (openai-agents) { class: ours }
api: OpenAI API (Responses API) { class: ext }

user -> script: 실행 + 불만 텍스트
script -> script: OPENAI_API_KEY 확인 (cp949 콘솔이면 여기서 UnicodeEncodeError)
script -> runner: Runner.run_sync(agent, text)
runner -> runner: output_type → strict JSON 스키마 생성
runner -> runner: 클라이언트 조회 (키 없으면 OpenAIError)
runner -> api: responses.create(text.format=json_schema)
api -> runner: 스키마에 맞춘 JSON
runner -> runner: validate_json → Pydantic 객체
runner -> script: RunResult.final_output
script -> user: 필드별로 정리해 출력
